    "Escrow is deployed — waiting for CirclePad to start the raise.": "托管合约已部署——等待 CirclePad 开启募集。", "Not live yet — the fund-pooling contract is in design and review.": "尚未上线——资金池合约正在设计与审查中。", "PREVIEW": "预览",
